gxde-nighttime-x11 (6.8.4-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial release, based on KNightTime 6.8.4.
  * Rename every installed artifact so that it can be installed next to the
    distribution knighttime packages:
    - library libgxde-nighttime-x11, CMake package gxde-nighttime-x11
      (target gxde-nighttime-x11::NightTime), headers under
      include/gxde-nighttime-x11;
    - daemon gxde-nighttime-x11d, D-Bus name com.gxde.NightTimeX11,
      systemd user unit gxde-nighttime-x11d.service;
    - config gxde-nighttime-x11rc / gxde-nighttime-x11staterc, migrated from
      the [NightColor] group of gxde-kwin_x11rc.
  * Build against the Qt 6.8 / KDE Frameworks 6.13 stack of GXDE 25.5:
    - bundle fallbacks for KHolidays::SunEvents and KSystemClockSkewNotifier,
      which only exist in KDE Frameworks 6.15 and later;
    - store SunriseStart/SunsetStart as String entries, using the same
      on-disk format as the KConfig Time type.

 -- CharOfString <root@charofstring.cc>  Thu, 12 Nov 2026 16:30:09 -0600
